    "description": "Blocky Car Racer is a new racing game where you can drive with traffic in a colorful blocky world!\r\nJump into muscle car and hit the road! Drive as fast as you can and avoid crashes in race mode. Ready to blow up some cars? Start the rampage in demolition mode and smashed them all!\r\nIn the last mode you can relax and drive through the big city full of hidden features. \r\nFunny crash? Share your GIF to your friends on social networks!\r\n\r\nThis is official sequel of Blocky Moto Racing game where we guarantee you a lot of fun.\r\n\r\n\r\nDEMOLITION MODE: \r\n- you have 2 minutes to smash as many cars as possible \r\n- crash other cars to make them explode!\r\n- destroy few cars in a row to receive combo bonus!\r\n\r\nRACE MODE: \r\n- endless race\r\n- drive as fast as you can and survive as long\r\n- get the highest score and achieve the best distance.\r\n- watch out for cars and obstacles like trains, police, firefighters, blockades or road repairs\r\n- receive bonus points thanks to speed trap camera!\r\n\r\n CITY MODE: \r\n- big city full of streets, traffic and airport with planes!\r\n- exploding barrels with hidden features! \r\n- discover special events after hitting the barrels like change of the light, night club or exploding buildings!\r\n- city is a free run mode. Just relax and enjoy the ride.\r\n- lot of railroads for train fans\r\n- challenges! find glowing spots and start short time missions\r\n- ramps and trampolines! try to achieve best air time!\r\n\r\nCUSTOMIZATION:\r\n- choose your favorite car color!\r\n- take roof down on Muscle car!\r\n- disassemble hood engine on Beast to achieve more classy look!\r\n- gold rims for each car!\r\n- put flames on Bummer or take bumpers off!\r\n- take off stripes on Sport GT or put blue color on them!\r\n- unlock power engine and feel the extreme acceleration!\r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n- 4 different camera views including car interiors!\r\n- 7 car types. Muscle car, Bummer, Police and ultra fast Sport GT! Recently we added 3 new cars!\r\n- GIF sharing. Show your funny GIFs to your friends! \r\n- Amazing engine sounds. Hear the V8 sound of the Beast car!\r\n- low poly style buildings and vehicles\r\n- Three game modes: endless Race, Demolition and free run City\r\n- lot of NPC traffic including cars, buses, trams and trucks\r\n- Nitro (NOS) and Handbrake feature\r\n- Realistic car physics\r\n- Leaderboards and achievements\r\n- offline game mode\r\n\r\nTIPS\r\n- achieve better score by riding faster\r\n- get more score by collecting golden coins\r\n- NOS unlocks after 1 km and handbrake after 2 kilometers in Race mode\r\n- To unlock Bummer or Sport GT car - play the game for 60 or 120 minutes\r\n- Buy anything to unlock all cars and remove ads\r\n- In Demolition mode try to smash the side of the cars. This way you will not decrease much speed. Avoid direct hits.\r\n- In Race mode, slow down when you see the train to avoid crash.\r\n- test cars or check their max speed in the demolition or city mode. These are crashless games.\r\n- with the enabled internet connection you can recover from crash one time by watching video.\r\n- Send your crash GIFs to us to get promoted on our Facebook page! \r\n\r\n\r\nCheck our other game Blocky Moto Racing if you want to drive motorcycles!\r\n\r\n\r\nKeep updated - subscribe now!\r\nWebsite: www.mobadu.pl\r\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/3Dmaze\r\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/MobaduApps\r\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/mobadu/",
